er per file"><mxGeometry x="2750.0" y="1076.0" width="750.0" height="40.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ns-n3" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;my-review/sha256-&amp;lt;hash&amp;gt;/"><mxGeometry x="1970.0" y="1126.0" width="760.0" height="40.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ns-d3" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;fontColor=#3D4A57;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" value="data.csv"><mxGeometry x="2750.0" y="1128.0" width="750.0" height="40.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ns-n4" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="models/&amp;lt;ModelId&amp;gt;/"><mxGeometry x="1970.0" y="1178.0" width="760.0" height="40.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ns-d4" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;fontColor=#3D4A57;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" value="the training and inference runs above"><mxGeometry x="2750.0" y="1180.0" width="750.0" height="40.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#27764B&quot;&gt;Green&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; marks the files other processes usually pick up."><mxGeometry x="70.0" y="1400.0" width="3460.0" height="60.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cache" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;fontColor=#6B7785;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;Cached steps.&lt;/b&gt; A step whose inputs and settings are unchanged can be reused for up to 24 hours. Its files then stay in the earlier run's folder: in the run shown, GetData was reused from an earlier execution. Follow the step's job in Studio, or its _execution.json, rather than building the path from the current execution ID."><mxGeometry x="70.0" y="1460.0" width="3460.0" height="120.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="fig-code" name="How the code fits together"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="3400" pageHeight="1200" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="page-bg" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;locked=1;movable=0;resizable=0;selectable=0;" value=""><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="0.0" width="3400.0" height="1200.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=52;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" value="How a pipeline step finds your model code"><mxGeometry x="70.0" y="50.0" width="3260.0" height="70.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=28;fontColor=#6B7785;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" value="Every step calls one entrypoint. The entrypoint uses your use-case code if it exists, otherwise the shared base. Both read the mode